  "Starting cards per the strategy: Hunt Down And Destroy The Jedi, Executor: Meditation Chamber, Executor: Holotheatre and Visage Of The Emperor, with Prepared Defenses pulling Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points and 'an effect of choice (generally No Escape)'. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set. Total 60 as published.",
